Output demo/solidarity-builder.gif

Require solidarity-builder

Set Shell "bash"
Set Framerate 60
Set FontSize 12
Set Width 800
Set Height 400
Set Padding 20
Set Margin 5
Set MarginFill "#212830"
Set BorderRadius 10

Hide
Type 'cd /tmp/solidarity-builder-demo && clear' Enter
Show

Type "solidarity-builder" Sleep 500ms Enter
Sleep 1800ms

Enter
Sleep 1500ms

Space Sleep 700ms
Down Sleep 400ms
Space Sleep 700ms
Down Sleep 400ms
Space Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms

Type "cat .solidarity.json | head -20" Sleep 200ms Enter
Wait Sleep 2000ms

Sleep 2s
